[00:00.90]Lesson 135 | 第135课
[00:03.73]The latest report | 最新报道
[00:06.82]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:12.23]Is Karen Marsh going to retire, do you think? | 你认为卡伦·马什会退休吗?
[00:18.83]Are you really going to retire, Miss Marsh? | 马什小姐,您真的打算退休吗?
[00:23.10]I may. | 可能会。
[00:24.66]I can't make up my mind. | 我做不了决定。
[00:27.98]I will have to ask my future husband. | 我将不得不问问我未来的丈夫。
[00:32.42]He won't let me make another film. | 他不会让我再拍电影。
[00:36.64]Your future husband, Miss Marsh? | 您未来的丈夫,马什小姐?
[00:39.99]Yes. | 是的。
[00:41.16]Let me introduce him to you. | 让我把他介绍给您。
[00:44.22]His name is Carlos. | 他叫卡洛斯。
[00:47.66]We're going to get married next week. | 我们下周就要结婚了。
[00:53.00]Look, Liz! | 莉兹,你看!
[00:54.66]Here's another report about Karen Marsh. | 这儿有一篇关于卡伦·马什的报道。
[00:59.22]Listen: 'Karen Marsh: The latest. | 听听:'卡伦·马什:最新消息。
[01:04.66]At her London Hotel today Miss Marsh told reporters she might retire. | 今天在伦敦酒店,马什小姐告诉记者她可能会退休。
[01:13.75]She said she couldn't make up her mind. | 她说她做不了决定。
[01:18.11]She said she would have to ask her future husband. | 她说她将不得不问问她未来的丈夫。
[01:24.33]She said her future husband would not let her make another film. | 她说她未来的丈夫不会让她再拍电影。
[01:32.03]Then she introduced us to Carlos and told us they would get married next week.' | 然后她把我们介绍给了卡洛斯,并告诉我们他们下周就要结婚了。'
[01:41.87]That's sensational news, isn't it, Kate? | 那是爆炸性新闻,不是吗,凯特?
[01:47.48]It certainly is. | 确实是。
[01:49.80]He'll be her sixth husband! | 他将是她的第六任丈夫!